        "title": "Very interesting, lovely photos, cultural, religious, fascinating",
        "text": "If you love taking photos, love quirky stuff (like Varanasi India but on a much much smaller scale)... you can see cremations, photos are allowed... you can wonder around and just sit and watch, there is so much to see if you do this. Take a stroll up the steps to some lovely temples, loads of monkeys around. Easy to get there via green Sahja Yatayat bus about 20 rupees..... well worth the trip, entry is 1000rs which is steep but as I like this sort of thing it was ok to pay this amount.  ",
